1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:03,420
(Raj:)Our dreams are very small,
aren't they?

2
00:00:05,423 --> 00:00:08,963
(Sheldon:)Good news, gentlemen.
I have tentatively accepted...

3
00:00:09,176 --> 00:00:11,056
ALL:
Yeah!

4
00:00:15,099 --> 00:00:18,019
(Sheldon:)...the invitation
to join the Arctic expedition.

5
00:00:18,436 --> 00:00:21,606
- It's not gonna be the same without you.
- We're gonna miss you.

6
00:00:21,772 --> 00:00:25,272
(Sheldon:)Thank you,
but your sentiments may be premature.

7
00:00:25,443 --> 00:00:27,863
(Raj:)Oh, I don't like where this is going.

8
00:00:28,029 --> 00:00:29,989
(Sheldon:)I would like to propose...

9
00:00:30,906 --> 00:00:33,286
(Sheldon:)...that the three of you
accompany me.

10
00:00:33,451 --> 00:00:37,081
(Leonard:)- To the North Pole?
- Yes.

11
00:00:37,246 --> 00:00:40,416
(Raj:)Is this just so we won't touch your stuff
while you're away?

12
00:00:42,043 --> 00:00:44,373
(Sheldon:)I'll admit that was a concern.

13
00:00:44,545 --> 00:00:49,215
(Sheldon:)But the fact is, I'll need a support team
and the three of you are my first choice.

14
00:00:49,383 --> 00:00:52,013
- Really?
- Others might be more qualified...

15
00:00:52,178 --> 00:00:55,308
(Sheldon:)...but the thought of interviewing them
gave me a stomachache.

16
00:00:56,140 --> 00:00:58,520
(Sheldon:)I know I'm proposing
an enormous undertaking...

17
00:00:58,684 --> 00:01:03,024
(Sheldon:)...so why don't you take a few moments
to discuss it?

